description: Do not add Cursor as a git co-author on commits
alwaysApply: true
---

# No Cursor commit attribution

Never add any of the following to commits, PR descriptions, or commit messages:

- `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>`
- `Made-with: Cursor`
- Any other Cursor agent attribution trailer

Commits must be attributed only to the human developer.
